    "show_share": true,
    "description": "His Highness the Aga Khan, Chancellor of the Aga Khan University (AKU), today urged the Class of 2025 to harness the \"extraordinary opportunity\" of modern knowledge to address global challenges. He emphasized that education is the most powerful tool for changing lives and societies.",
